  "summary": "The Bibi-Khanym Mosque in Samarkand, Uzbekistan, was begun by Timur in 1399 and finished around 1405, according to History Hit; a Samarkand tour operator gives 1399–1404. The inner portal collapsed in an 1897 earthquake, the building decayed into a ruin, and Soviet-era and later work reconstructed it. History Hit gives its dome as about 40 metres high.",
